<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Chinese 3 · Paper C · Optional preparation</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-3/c/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 3 Course Review · Original Paper C</p><h1>Optional preparation</h1><p>40 objective questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks · 90-minute section budget.</p><p class="note">Reference materials. Open the workspace for section clocks, local answer saving and recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or your own teacher; no automatic grade.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="student-traditional.html">繁體試卷</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Chinese 3 C</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><p>Optional before-practice support. No pinyin is shown in the learner paper. This is an author-selected list, not a complete calibrated word list.</p><p class="cn">图书角 <span class="note">classroom book corner</span></p><p class="cn">软件 <span class="note">software</span></p><p class="cn">资格 <span class="note">qualification</span></p><p class="cn">标志 <span class="note">sign</span></p><p class="cn">讲解 <span class="note">explanation</span></p><p class="cn">对应 <span class="note">corresponding</span></p><p class="cn">短片 <span class="note">short video</span></p><p class="cn">参观 <span class="note">visit/tour</span></p><p class="cn">耳机 <span class="note">headphones</span></p><p class="cn">名额 <span class="note">available place</span></p><p class="cn">片段 <span class="note">short extract</span></p><p class="cn">顺序 <span class="note">sequence</span></p><p class="cn">校园广播 <span class="note">school radio broadcast</span></p><p class="cn">播音员 <span class="note">radio announcer</span></p><p class="cn">停顿 <span class="note">pause</span></p><p class="cn">交稿 <span class="note">submit a script/recording</span></p><p class="cn">提示牌 <span class="note">information sign</span></p><p class="cn">小苗 <span class="note">young seedlings</span></p><p class="cn">可重复使用 <span class="note">reusable</span></p><p class="cn">餐具 <span class="note">cutlery</span></p><p class="cn">归还 <span class="note">return a borrowed item</span></p><p class="cn">戏剧社 <span class="note">drama club</span></p><p class="cn">收获 <span class="note">something learned/gained</span></p><p class="cn">重点 <span class="note">main point</span></p><p class="cn">塞进去 <span class="note">cram into</span></p><p class="cn">转到 <span class="note">transfer to</span></p><p class="cn">班会 <span class="note">class meeting</span></p><p class="cn">桌面游戏 <span class="note">tabletop game</span></p><p class="cn">规则 <span class="note">rules</span></p><p class="cn">说明书 <span class="note">instruction booklet</span></p><p class="cn">序号 <span class="note">step number</span></p><p class="cn">试读 <span class="note">try reading</span></p><p class="cn">海报 <span class="note">poster</span></p><p class="cn">标题 <span class="note">heading/title</span></p><p class="cn">脚本 <span class="note">script</span></p><p class="cn">图文导览 <span class="note">picture-and-text guide</span></p><p class="cn">对应 <span class="note">correspond exactly</span></p><p class="cn">版本 <span class="note">version</span></p><p class="cn">向导 <span class="note">guide</span></p><p class="cn">无所不知 <span class="note">know everything</span></p><p class="cn">邀请卡 <span class="note">invitation card</span></p><p class="cn">抽屉 <span class="note">drawer</span></p><p class="cn">集合处 <span class="note">meeting point</span></p><p class="cn">硬纸板 <span class="note">cardboard</span></p><p class="cn">支架 <span class="note">stand</span></p><p class="cn">放置 <span class="note">put in position</span></p><p class="cn">试行 <span class="note">trial implementation</span></p><p class="cn">纸本 <span class="note">paper copy</span></p><p class="cn">摄影社 <span class="note">photography club</span></p><p class="cn">空余 <span class="note">free time</span></p><p class="cn">带队 <span class="note">lead a group</span></p><p class="cn">当场 <span class="note">on the spot</span></p></section></main></body></html>